[     script:lb-phone] 2.9.0:
[     script:lb-phone]   Exports:
[     script:lb-phone]     - New export, `exports["lb-phone"]:SetPhonePartiallyVisible(0-100)`, allows you to control how much of the phone should show.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Added a new export, `exports["lb-phone"]:ForwardCall(source, options)`, that allows you to forward a custom call before it has been answered.
[     script:lb-phone]   InstaPic:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Added support for Cloudflare Realtime SFU for InstaPic live, to improve performance with many viewers.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Added a new export `exports["lb-phone"]:PostInstaPic(username, media, caption, location)`.
[     script:lb-phone]     - The InstaPic app now gets properly reset when switching between phones with unique phones enabled.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a rare bug that would cause a crash in DMs
[     script:lb-phone]   Garage:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Made garage vehicle icons configurable per car.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed the garage app being laggy with plenty of cars in it, now it uses virtualized loading.
[     script:lb-phone]   Birdy:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed several UI bugs in the birdy app, where you couldn't see / properly scroll in Birdy comments.
[     script:lb-phone]     - The Birdy app now gets properly reset when switching between phones with unique phones enabled.
[     script:lb-phone]   Camera:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a bug that would cause the rear camera in portrait mode to take landscape photos.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fix camera/gamerender size not rendering correctly on 5K.
[     script:lb-phone]   Locales:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Added missing localizations.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated English (`en.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated German (`de.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated Spanish (`es.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated French (`fr.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated Hungarian (`hu.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated Portuguese (`pt-br.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated Romanian (`ro.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]     - Updated Ukrainian (`ua.json`).
[     script:lb-phone]   Other:
[     script:lb-phone]     - Added support for company calls for dynamic & custom numbers.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed several UI bugs in the photos app, regarding navigation & loading.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a bug in the message app that would open the wrong conversation at rare times.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a bug that would duplicate individuals in the services employee list.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a bug where the search within the Marketplace app wouldnt work properly.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed new line formatting on mails between phone & tablet.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed giving & removing item not updating on the latest version of qb-core.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Now allows for custom form data in upload.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed a race condition in spark, which caused an error in the "spark:createAccount" callback.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Fixed the phone scale not updating when FiveM got resized.
[     script:lb-phone]     - Toggling airplane mode now immediately saves settings, to make the backend sync various features.
